howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 1
omission MissingDeclaration(Class(http://example.org/t#B))
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 5
sub http://example.org/t#A http://example.org/t#A
sub http://example.org/t#A http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#C http://example.org/t#C
sub http://example.org/t#C http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
